                  "from": 273.655,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2889676,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I know the contribution of cinema and jazz was considered, but the designers finally opted for rockets and the International Space Station.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 287.27,
